{% comment %}
  modules/accela_construct/commands/records/initialize/build

  Normalizes input and prepares the request for POST /v4/records/initialize:
  the request path (relative to ACCELA_CONSTRUCT_BASE_URL) and the JSON-serialized
  record body.

  Params:
    object - Hash with `record` (see records/initialize.liquid)

  Returns object with `path` and `payload` added.
{% endcomment %}

{% liquid
  assign object.path = '/records/initialize'
  assign object.payload = object.record | json
  return object
%}
